<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/70802ANLCHJCJMRBSLVTCVKBSQQLMHBLN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Friday the 13th: Babes in the Bush Burlesque";
  schema:description """
	A dazzling evening featuring Yukon’s finest burlesque, drag, and circus performers, alongside spectacular special guests:<span><br/></span>Zyra Lee Vanity (Toronto)<span><br/></span>Chelsea Hart (Whitehorse and Vancouver)<span><br/></span>Vivian Vanguard (Edmonton)<span><br/></span>Chérie Coquette (Whitehorse)<span><br/></span>Hosted by the fabulous Kaska Kween, Ella Lamoureux!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Forget everything you've heard about Friday the 13th. Instead of bad luck, we're celebrating radical joy, glamour, and unapologetic self-expression during the darkest time of the year.<span><br/></span>Join us for an unforgettable evening of dazzling performances, jaw-dropping talent, laughter, and a whole lot of sparkle. From seductive burlesque to electrifying drag and breathtaking circus acts, this is a night where superstition gives way to celebration.<span><br/></span>Come embrace the magic, cheer on incredible artists, and experience a Friday the 13th you'll never forget! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Follow your artists on social media<span><br/></span>Babes in the Bush Burlesque: https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">babesinthebushburlesque</span><span><br/></span>Zyra Lee Vanity:  https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">zyraleevanity</span><span><br/></span>Chelsea Hart: https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">chelseahart<span class=\"UnderlineText\"></span></span><span><br/></span>Vivian Vanguard: https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">vivianvanguard</span> <span><br/></span>Ella Lamoureux: https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">kaskakween</span><span><br/></span>Chérie Coquette: https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.instagram.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">cheriecoquetteburlesque</span><span><br/></span>https:<span class=\"ItalicText\"></span>www.facebook.com<span class=\"ItalicText\">cheriecoquettecabaret</span><span><br/></span>
""";
