<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/73601AGTJSDMRRHHCHRQSCLRVRLDPRMQN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "James Ehnes - 50th Birthday Tour";
  schema:description """
	World-class artistry. Northern collaboration. One unforgettable evening. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Whitehorse Concerts is proud to present internationally acclaimed violinist James Ehnes and pianist Andrew Armstrong as part of James Ehnes' 50th Birthday Tour. The evening features the audience favourite Vivaldi's Winter from The Four Seasons performed with a Yukon string orchestra, alongside a new commission by Northwest Territories composer Carmen Braden. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It's a rare opportunity to experience one of the world's leading violinists in an intimate recital while celebrating the remarkable musical talent of the North.
""";
