<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/72601AQJVHVKDHQRVMNGTMDJCDMLPKDVS>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Jazz on the Wing: Trumpet Fiesta & Cuban Master Miguelito Valdes";
  schema:description """
	“Music is the true way of expressing my feelings...” - Miguelito Valdes <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Trumpet Fiesta presents a hard-swingin’ sweet & soulful program starring virtuoso Miguelito Valdes described as one of Cuba's most highly regarded trumpet players of his generation & young lion Lachlan Craven; coming together to share the rare beauty of two trumpets playing together in a quintet setting. Completing the Quintet is an all-star rhythm section consisting of Andrew Janusson, Brock Meades, and Keby MacNayr. Showcasing well known two-trumpet repertoire as well as original arrangements; 2 delicately crafted sets of music have been created for this special show. One night only!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Miguelito Valdes carries a rich history of performing with many of Cuba's top performers, including the Cabaret Tropicana Orquesta, Pablo Milanes, Isaac Delgado, Chucho Valdes, and has participated in award-winning recordings such as \"La Rumba Soy Yo\", which won a Latin Grammy in 2001. He has also played with legendary jazz musicians abroad, including Michael Brecker, Herbie Hancock, John Patitucci, Danilo Perez, Wayne Shorter, and many others. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Miguelito Valdes – trumpet, Lachlan Craven – trumpet, Brock Meades – upright bass, Andrew Jannusson – guitar, Kelby McNayr – drums <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>SPECIAL OFFER UNTIL SEPT 27, BUY 5 Jazz on the Wing tickets FOR THE PRICE OF 4.<span><br/></span>Adults: $132, Youth: $60<span><br/></span>Purchase at Yukon Arts Centre Box Office 667-8574 by phone or in-person.   <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jazz on the Wing cabaret<span><br/></span>Presented by Jazz Yukon<span><br/></span>More info: jazzyukon.ca<span><br/></span>
""";
