<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/71801ABVJVLDBDPJBNLJVMTCQQRSJHMBM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "SISTERS - A Dance & Theatre Show";
  schema:description """
	SISTERS is a heartfelt dance-theatre production that delves into the journey of two sisters as they navigate the beauty, complexity, and challenges of growing up together. Blending dynamic multi-style movement with original live music performed by local musicians, this family-friendly production offers a moving and entertaining experience for audiences of all ages.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Set against the backdrop of growing up in the North and venturing out into the wider world together, SISTERS explores the emotional, psychological, and social landscapes of sisterhood—celebrating the bonds that shape us, the moments that challenge us, and the love that carries us through.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring Jada Powell and Alita Powell as the lead dancers, with their father, Lonnie Powell on live percussion, SISTERS is a unique family collaboration that brings an added depth of authenticity and connection to the performance.<span><br/></span>
""";
