<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/71601AMRKGCHRRTHJRLKKPCDSPHMKGQPR>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Whitewater Wednesday 30th Anniversary Show";
  schema:description """
	Come celebrate 30 Years of Whitewater Wednesdays – Three Decades of Music, Community and Memories. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets are pay-what-you-decide, from $10 - $50 (choose your price from the drop-down menu.)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come celebrate the 30th Anniversary of Whitewater Wednesdays! The Whitewater Wednesday Jam hits the main stage at the Yukon Arts Centre. Curated by Peggy Hanifan – who founded WWW 30 years ago, this will be a testament to Peggy’s hard work and dedication to generations of Yukon musicians. This promises to be a night to remember – with specials guests from afar, and local musicians on stage, directed as always, by Peggy. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Three decades of Music, Community and Memories!
""";
